  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The application would result in the loss of a dwellinghouse and in the absence of a legal agreement, the development fails to secure a nomination agreement agreed with the Council to maximise the utilisation for local residents, and to ensure against the importation of need from outside the Borough, and any necessary monitoring fees and planning services fees. The application has also failed to show compliance with other provisions of Local Plan policy SC8. The development would therefore be contrary to adopted Local Plan policies SC1, SC8 and IMP3.",
    "Reason : 2 - The application has failed to demonstrate how the proposal would avoid adverse impacts on the living conditions of neighbouring residents arising from the increased comings and goings and other noise disturbances associated with the proposed use. The development would therefore be contrary to adopted Local Plan policies CC2 and EQ5.",
    "Reason : 3 - The application has failed to consider the transport impacts arising through the proposed change of use and in particular has failed to show that the proposal would not result in increased parking stress or prejudice highway safety, contrary to London Plan policies T5 and T6 and Local Plan policy EC2."
  ],
